What this licence does NOT cover

The MIT licence above applies to the source code only. The following are
Copyright (c) 2026 Ogechukwu Adama, all rights reserved, and are not licensed
for reuse:

  - the curriculum: content/lessons/, the item bank in scripts/level1-items.ts,
    and the generated content/level1.json. The lessons summarise public
    teaching by third parties (ICT and TTrades, cited lesson by lesson in
    docs/LESSON_SOURCES.md), whose ideas remain theirs;
  - the lesson recordings;
  - the dissertation report and its figures (docs/report/, docs/report-figures/).

The historical price bars behind the real-chart case studies come from a
public data provider and are used for education under its terms; they are
not redistributed as a dataset.

